  "bodyHash": "c1f178e02a6c456c",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">这是一个简单的 Flashlight（手电筒）1.7.10 模组（来源：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmod%252fflashlight-mod%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/mod/flashlight-mod/</a>），已移植至 Minecraft 1.12.2 及更新版本。</span></span><span><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您仅需纯客户端侧的手电筒功能（无需物品），请改用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flashlight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Better </strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Flashlight</strong></span> </a>模组！</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">该模组仅添加了这一件物品（2.0.0 及以上版本额外添加电池）。<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span>手电筒</span><span>可在主手和副手</span><span>中使用</span><span>。</span> <span><span>它</span></span> <span><span>与</span></span> <span><span>该</span></span><span><span>的</span></span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hardcore-darkness\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>HardcoreDarkness</span></a> <span>模组完美契合：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/343/812/1.png\" alt=\"1\" width=\"785\" height=\"407\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>电池安装：</strong></h4>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\">将<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">电池</span>置于<em><strong>副手</strong></em>，将<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">手电筒</span>置于<em><strong>主手</strong></em>中，然后<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">右键点击</span></span></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">合成配方：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">v1.X.X：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/343/816/flcrafting.PNG\" alt=\"2\" width=\"241\" height=\"136\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">v2.X.X：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">手电筒:<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/343/816/flcrafting.PNG\" alt=\"2\" width=\"241\" height=\"136\"><br>电池:<br><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/787378778056687626/968240226269020270/unknown.png\" alt=\"b\" width=\"240\" height=\"133\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">配置文件说明：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">v1.X.X：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/343/815/config.PNG\" alt=\"3\" width=\"257\" height=\"148\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;v2.X.X：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/787378778056687626/968240734153080862/unknown.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"453\" height=\"202\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>[ !! ]</strong></em></span> 在我的模组开发中，1.12.2 版本将始终优先获得支持，因此新版本更新可能需要较长时间，敬请谅解。<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>[ !! ]</strong></em></span><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>体验我的其他模组：<br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/groundores\" rel=\"nofollow\">GroundOres</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/world-defender\" rel=\"nofollow\">World Defender</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vpn-blocker\" rel=\"nofollow\">VPN Blocker</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dgweapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">DGWeapons</a></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>或加入我的 Discord 服务器：<em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/JAgyak99mt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/JAgyak99mt</a></span></em></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;<em><strong><span style=\"color:#333\"><br></span></strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span><span><span>本模组可在公共 Minecraft 服务器中正常使用，不会造成任何问题。</span></span></span></span></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
